1
00:00:14,496 --> 00:00:18,500
Bonjour, pardon, où est la gare ?
Hello, excuse me, where is the station?

2
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:24,380
Bonjour. La gare est là, dans le centre-ville.
Hello. The station is there, downtown.

3
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:29,804
Merci. Le bus pour le centre-ville passe ici ?
Thank you. Does the bus to the city center come here?

4
00:00:29,904 --> 00:00:34,244
Oui, le bus passe ici et arrive bientôt.
Yes, the bus comes here and will arrive soon.

5
00:00:34,344 --> 00:00:37,316
Quand, s’il vous plaît ?
When, please?

6
00:00:37,416 --> 00:00:40,676
Je ne sais pas, pardon.
I don’t know, sorry.

7
00:00:40,776 --> 00:00:45,404
D’accord. Je peux attendre ici ?
All right. Can I wait here?

8
00:00:45,504 --> 00:00:50,612
Oui, bien sûr. Il arrive bientôt.
Yes, of course. It will arrive soon.

9
00:00:50,712 --> 00:00:55,172
Merci beaucoup. Au revoir.
Thank you very much. Goodbye.
